 The [current screen catalog](README.md) uses actual local Chromium production-build captures, with illustrative QA names/audio/statistics. It covers all ten functional screens, six mode configurations, the custom editor and safety modal, including the newly requested edit/type-image/reset corrections. Earlier 27 unique images are retained by change ID in the archive; immutable reviewed links remain unchanged.
 
 [Handgun](../../public/gun-types/handgun.svg), [rifle/carbine](../../public/gun-types/rifle.svg), [shotgun](../../public/gun-types/shotgun.svg) and [unassigned-type placeholder](../../public/gun-types/unknown.svg) are simple SVG paths authored locally for this project. No manufacturer mark, competitor artwork, stock image or external icon pack was imported. These are generic type illustrations, not accurate firearm diagrams or proof of exclusive design/trademark clearance.
+
+CHG-060 favicon is a format/size derivative of the existing approved public/icon-512.png, encoded locally as ICO16/32/48px. No new logo artwork, external image source or exclusivity/legal-clearance claim. Public manuals reuse repository-owned content and existing exported GIF bytes.
