+# Public website — shared static layout
+
+CHG-060,2026-10-24. [Public SEO requirements](../../../requirements/public-seo.md) own behavior. PublicPage composes shared chrome with real links, Dark default, white text, orange action and fixed navigation. Content is readable without JS/profile/microphone and reuses actual in-app manuals. [SEO route plan](../../../seo/indexable-routes-plan.md) owns URLs; [history](../../../project/implementation-history.md) separates acceptance/publication from live deployment.
+
+| Page | Current capture |
+| --- | --- |
+| home | [home.dark.png](home.dark.png) |
+| practice | [practice.dark.png](practice.dark.png) |
+| single | [single.dark.png](single.dark.png) |
+| repeated | [repeated.dark.png](repeated.dark.png) |
+| par | [par.dark.png](par.dark.png) |
+| control | [control.dark.png](control.dark.png) |
+| sequence | [sequence.dark.png](sequence.dark.png) |
+| calibration | [calibration.dark.png](calibration.dark.png) |
+| help | [help.dark.png](help.dark.png) |
+| about | [about.dark.png](about.dark.png) |
+| contact | [contact.dark.png](contact.dark.png) |
+
+Public images use no personal fixtures. Nonproduction /welcome/ previews the .com landing with noindex; production redirects that preview alias to root. Existing app images/GIF appearance remains unchanged.
